  app is the sharp edge — shipped builds can't be updated in lockstep, so 3.2+ clients in the field break until users
  upgrade. The nightly partner export is the silent one: it likely won't error, it'll just start emitting rows with a
  missing/blank user identifier.

  There's no consumer code in this repo, so the rename here can't be coordinated with them — this change is only safe
  alongside a client rollout or a version bump.

  How do you want to proceed?

